Tax Calculation (Finance Scenario)

Business Scenario

A finance system calculates income tax for employees.

Tax rules:

Salary ≤ 5,00,000 → 0% tax
Salary between 5,00,001 and 10,00,000 → 10%
Salary > 10,00,000 → 20%

Create a UDF that returns the tax amount based on salary.
--------

create function dbo.scalar(@salary int)
returns int
as
begin
declare @tax int
if @salary <= 500000
set @tax = 0

else if @salary between 500001 and 1000000
set @tax = @salary * 0.10

else
set @tax = @salary * 0.20

return @tax
end
