Business Scenario

Reports are generated daily, weekly, monthly.

Every report needs:
Start date
End date

Question

Create a reusable TVF that returns records between two dates.

Orders(orderid,customerid,orderdate,totalamount)

input start date, end date

return order info for those orders in that range
---------
display custinfo as well, you have another table:

customer(customerid, custname)
---------

create function reports(@stdate date,@enddate date)
returns @result table(orderid int,customerid int,orderdate date,totalamount int)
as
begin

insert into @result
select orderid, o.customerid, o.orderdate, o.totalamount,c.custname
from orders o
join customer c
on o.customerid = c.customerid
where orderdate between @stdate and @enddate
return
end

